Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 16:47:26 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Restyle posts: essay-sized serif titles, LaTeX-style
 theorem boxes

- Title, section headings and homepage list use the body serif (Source Serif 4)
  at Substack-like sizes; body text 15px -> 18px
- Section headings lose the divider line and big gap
- Theorem/definition boxes: run-in bold label, thin left rule, no outer border
- Wide display equations scroll on their own on phones
- Footer divider matches the text column; contents sidebar numbers match headings
- README: local setup steps for Apple Silicon Macs

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015sajfvtPmGkb5ceTztqXFY
